### Part 4A additions — VS Code REST Client
# Log in first (seed credentials), then copy the access token into @token.
@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-access-token
@platformToken = paste-platform-admin-access-token

### Log in as the demo school admin (throttled: AUTH_THROTTLE_RATE per IP)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@kampaladps.schooldimes.test", "password": "pw123456" }

### Section A — my school's name and branding
GET {{base}}/my-school/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Section B — pending data requests (overview count)
GET {{base}}/privacy/data-requests/?status=pending&page_size=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
